<!--DDF1D8A6BF2046F5890984B2E3EDD897-->  <NAME><![CDATA[Task No Task Type]]></NAME>
<!--DDF1D8A6BF2046F5890984B2E3EDD897-->  <DESCRIPTION><![CDATA[Generates the Task No. using a transactional sequence filtered by Task Type as a dimension.  The sequence is resolved dynamically based on the selected Task Type, Client, and Organization to ensure independent numbering per task category.]]></DESCRIPTION>
<!--DDF1D8A6BF2046F5890984B2E3EDD897-->  <HELP><![CDATA[This reference uses the TaskTypeTransactionalSequence generator to assign document numbers to Tasks.
The sequence is determined using the Task Type (EM_Etask_Task_Type_ID) as a dimension in AD_Sequence, allowing each Task Type to maintain its own numbering logic.
A preview value is displayed when creating a new record, and the final number is generated transactionally upon saving to prevent gaps and ensure consistency.
Do not modify the generator class or dimension configuration unless you fully understand the transactional sequence mechanism.]]></HELP>
